  "summary": {
    "ja": "極座標(r,θ)の双線形基底でCartesian速度2成分を近似し、円環の可変粘性応力発散BVPを解く。正確なrのJacobian、物理勾配、結合したひずみ弱形式を組み立てる。",
    "en": "Approximate two Cartesian velocity components with bilinear(r,theta) basis functions for an annular variable-viscosity stress BVP. Assemble the exact polar Jacobian,physical gradients and coupled strain weak form."
  },
  "status": "educational-example",
  "origin": "curated-mapped-q1-vector-bvp",
