  "assumptions": [
    "Bilinear basis in(r,theta) with exact polar geometry Jacobian r,1<=r<=2,periodic theta.",
    "Unknowns are two Cartesian velocity components; lambda0 variable-mu linear stress-divergence BVP.",
    "Physical-gradient transform and engineering-strain block weak form explicitly derived in references/README.md."
  ],
  "assumptions_ja": [
    "1≤r≤2の円環、θ周期。基底は(r,θ)でQ1、正確な極座標Jacobian rを使う。",
    "未知数はCartesian速度2成分。λ=0、μ=1+r²/5の線形応力発散BVP。",
    "物理勾配とengineering strainの結合弱形式をreferences/README.mdで明示。"
  ],
  "units": "Dimensionless fixed annulus. In dimensional form traction has scale mu*U/L and body force mu*U/L².",
  "units_ja": "固定円環は無次元。次元を与えるなら牽引力の尺度はμU/L、体積力はμU/L²。",
  "boundary_conditions": "Zero Cartesian Dirichlet data on r1 and r2; periodic theta. Physical outward traction is measured,not prescribed.",
  "boundary_conditions_ja": "r1/r2でCartesian速度を零Dirichlet、θ周期。外向きの物理牽引力は測定し、境界値として課していない。",
  "limitations": {
    "ja": "指定円環のmapped Q1ベクトルBVPだけ。P1、一般四辺形・軸r0・圧力/非圧縮拘束・非線形Navier–Stokesではない。Nr8/16/32,Nθ2Nrの固定検査を一般認証へ拡張しない。",
    "en": "Mapped Q1 vector BVP on this annulus only; not P1,general quadrilaterals,an r0 axis,pressure/incompressibility or nonlinear Navier–Stokes. FixedNr8/16/32,Ntheta2Nr checks are not broad certification."
  },
